{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026y3E6DqBVqu1794837452.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港迪士尼明日起陸續展開聖誕節慶活動。</p><p></p><p>其中「美國小鎮大街」的聖誕樹，由本周四起每天傍晚會有亮燈儀式，配合無人機表演，展示迪士尼多款卡通人物，米奇等經典角色亦換上聖誕裝扮，與入場人士見面。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.DISNEY-1900_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AseSp2aMCE1794837482.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>園內多處均亦添置聖誕裝飾，而「魔雪奇緣世界」園區新設了冬日市集，有應節食品及攤位遊戲。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:39:08.622233+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T12:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:13.314604+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:32:33.248260+00:00","content_hash":"efba6ac73da831a5ec9062af8ff6c500c43c12272cd942ae1f4b5abedf103b5d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:39:08.622233+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}